    "Browser": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Browser"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"浏览器"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"瀏覽器"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Navegador"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"Browser"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Navegador"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ブラウザ"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"브라우저"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Navigateur"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ब्राउज़र"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"المتصفح"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"Browser"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tarayıcı"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Браузер"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Peramban"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Przeglądarka"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เบราว์เซอร์"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Trình duyệt"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"Browser"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"مرورگر"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Браузер"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Webbläsare"}}}},
    "Browser cookies for the configured domains will be sent to your remote Gateway. These cookies can grant access to your signed-in accounts.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Browser cookies for the configured domains will be sent to your remote Gateway. These cookies can grant access to your signed-in accounts."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已配置域名的浏览器 Cookie 将发送到你的远程 Gateway。这些 Cookie 可能授予对你已登录账户的访问权限。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已設定網域的瀏覽器 Cookie 將傳送至您的遠端 Gateway。這些 Cookie 可讓人存取您已登入的帳號。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Os cookies do navegador dos domínios configurados serão enviados ao seu Gateway remoto. Esses cookies podem conceder acesso às contas em que você está conectado."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Browser-Cookies für die konfigurierten Domains werden an Ihren entfernten Gateway gesendet. Diese Cookies können Zugriff auf die Konten gewähren, bei denen Sie angemeldet sind."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Las cookies del navegador de los dominios configurados se enviarán a tu Gateway remoto. Estas cookies pueden dar acceso a las cuentas en las que has iniciado sesión."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定されたドメインのブラウザCookieがリモートGatewayに送信されます。これらのCookieにより、ログイン済みのアカウントにアクセスできるようになる可能性があります。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"설정된 도메인의 브라우저 쿠키가 원격 Gateway로 전송됩니다. 이 쿠키를 통해 로그인된 계정에 접근할 수 있습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les cookies du navigateur pour les domaines configurés seront envoyés à votre Gateway distant. Ces cookies peuvent donner accès aux comptes auxquels vous êtes connecté."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"कॉन्फ़िगर किए गए डोमेन की ब्राउज़र कुकी आपके रिमोट Gateway को भेजी जाएँगी। ये कुकी उन खातों का ऐक्सेस दे सकती हैं जिनमें आपने साइन इन किया हुआ है।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ستُرسل ملفات تعريف ارتباط المتصفح للنطاقات التي تم إعدادها إلى Gateway البعيد الخاص بك. يمكن أن تتيح هذه الملفات الوصول إلى الحسابات التي سجلت الدخول إليها."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"I cookie del browser per i domini configurati verranno inviati al Gateway remoto. Questi cookie possono consentire l’accesso agli account a cui hai effettuato l’accesso."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yapılandırılmış alan adlarına ait tarayıcı çerezleri uzak Gateway'inize gönderilecektir. Bu çerezler, oturum açtığınız hesaplara erişim sağlayabilir."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Файли cookie браузера для налаштованих доменів буде надіслано до вашого віддаленого Gateway. Ці файли cookie можуть надати доступ до облікових записів, у які ви ввійшли."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookie browser untuk domain yang dikonfigurasi akan dikirim ke Gateway jarak jauh Anda. Cookie ini dapat memberikan akses ke akun yang sudah Anda masuki."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pliki cookie przeglądarki dla skonfigurowanych domen zostaną wysłane do zdalnego Gateway. Mogą one zapewnić dostęp do kont, na których jesteś zalogowany."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"คุกกี้เบราว์เซอร์สำหรับโดเมนที่กำหนดไว้จะถูกส่งไปยัง Gateway ระยะไกลของคุณ คุกกี้เหล่านี้อาจทำให้เข้าถึงบัญชีที่คุณลงชื่อเข้าใช้อยู่ได้"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookie trình duyệt cho các miền đã cấu hình sẽ được gửi đến Gateway từ xa của bạn. Những cookie này có thể cấp quyền truy cập vào các tài khoản bạn đã đăng nhập."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Browsercookies voor de geconfigureerde domeinen worden naar je externe Gateway verzonden. Deze cookies kunnen toegang geven tot de accounts waarop je bent ingelogd."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"کوکی‌های مرورگر برای دامنه‌های پیکربندی‌شده به Gateway راه دور شما ارسال می‌شوند. این کوکی‌ها می‌توانند امکان دسترسی به حساب‌هایی را فراهم کنند که وارد آن‌ها شده‌اید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Файлы cookie браузера для настроенных доменов будут отправлены на ваш удалённый Gateway. Эти файлы могут предоставить доступ к вашим учётным записям, в которые выполнен вход."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Webbläsarkakor för de konfigurerade domänerna skickas till din fjärranslutna Gateway. Dessa kakor kan ge åtkomst till konton där du är inloggad."}}}},
    "Browser import failed": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Browser import failed"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"浏览器导入失败"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"瀏覽器匯入失敗"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Falha na importação do navegador"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Browser-Import fehlgeschlagen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Error al importar desde el navegador"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ブラウザからのインポートに失敗しました"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"브라우저 가져오기 실패"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Échec de l’importation depuis le navigateur"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ब्राउज़र से इम्पोर्ट विफल रहा"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"فشل الاستيراد من المتصفح"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Importazione dal browser non riuscita"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tarayıcıdan içe aktarma başarısız oldu"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Не вдалося імпортувати з браузера"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Impor peramban gagal"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Import z przeglądarki nie powiódł się"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การนำเข้าจากเบราว์เซอร์ล้มเหลว"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nhập từ trình duyệt thất bại"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Browserimport mislukt"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"وارد کردن از مرورگر ناموفق بود"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Не удалось выполнить импорт из браузера"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Webbläsarimporten misslyckades"}}}},
    "Browser import requires Local mode": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Browser import requires Local mode"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"浏览器导入需要本地模式"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"瀏覽器匯入需要本機模式"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A importação do navegador requer o modo Local"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Der Browser-Import erfordert den lokalen Modus"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La importación desde el navegador requiere el modo Local"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ブラウザからのインポートにはローカルモードが必要です"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"브라우저 가져오기는 로컬 모드에서만 사용할 수 있습니다"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"L’importation depuis le navigateur nécessite le mode Local"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ब्राउज़र से इम्पोर्ट के लिए स्थानीय मोड आवश्यक है"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يتطلب الاستيراد من المتصفح الوضع المحلي"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"L'importazione dal browser richiede la modalità Locale"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tarayıcıdan içe aktarma için Yerel mod gerekir"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Для імпорту з браузера потрібен локальний режим"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Impor peramban memerlukan mode Lokal"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Import z przeglądarki wymaga trybu lokalnego"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การนำเข้าจากเบราว์เซอร์ต้องใช้โหมดภายในเครื่อง"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nhập từ trình duyệt yêu cầu chế độ Cục bộ"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Browserimport vereist de lokale modus"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"وارد کردن از مرورگر به حالت محلی نیاز دارد"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Для импорта из браузера требуется локальный режим"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Webbläsarimport kräver lokalt läge"}}}},
    "Browser import unavailable": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Browser import unavailable"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"浏览器导入不可用"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無法從瀏覽器匯入"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Importação do navegador indisponível"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Browser-Import nicht verfügbar"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Importación del navegador no disponible"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ブラウザからのインポートは利用できません"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"브라우저에서 가져올 수 없음"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Importation depuis le navigateur indisponible"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ब्राउज़र से आयात उपलब्ध नहीं है"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"الاستيراد من المتصفح غير متاح"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Importazione dal browser non disponibile"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tarayıcıdan içe aktarma kullanılamıyor"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Імпорт із браузера недоступний"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Impor browser tidak tersedia"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Import z przeglądarki niedostępny"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ไม่สามารถนำเข้าจากเบราว์เซอร์ได้"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Không thể nhập từ trình duyệt"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Browserimport niet beschikbaar"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"درون‌ریزی از مرورگر در دسترس نیست"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Импорт из браузера недоступен"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Webbläsarimport är inte tillgänglig"}}}},
    "Browser logins imported": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Browser logins imported"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已导入浏览器登录信息"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已匯入瀏覽器登入資訊"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Logins do navegador importados"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Browser-Anmeldungen importiert"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inicios de sesión del navegador importados"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ブラウザのログイン情報をインポートしました"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"브라우저 로그인 정보를 가져왔습니다"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Identifiants du navigateur importés"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ब्राउज़र लॉगिन आयात किए गए"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تم استيراد بيانات تسجيل الدخول من المتصفح"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Credenziali di accesso del browser importate"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tarayıcı oturumları içe aktarıldı"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Дані входу з браузера імпортовано"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Login browser diimpor"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zaimportowano dane logowania z przeglądarki"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"นำเข้าข้อมูลการเข้าสู่ระบบจากเบราว์เซอร์แล้ว"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Đã nhập thông tin đăng nhập từ trình duyệt"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Browseraanmeldingen geïmporteerd"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"اطلاعات ورود مرورگر درون‌ریزی شد"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Данные для входа из браузера импортированы"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Webbläsarinloggningar har importerats"}}}},
    "Browser sign-in expired. Reconnect this Gateway.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Browser sign-in expired. Reconnect this Gateway."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"浏览器登录已过期。请重新连接此 Gateway。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"瀏覽器登入已過期。請重新連線至此 Gateway。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A sessão no navegador expirou. Reconecte este Gateway."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die Browser-Anmeldung ist abgelaufen. Verbinden Sie diesen Gateway erneut."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La sesión del navegador ha caducado. Vuelve a conectar este Gateway."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ブラウザのサインインの有効期限が切れました。このGatewayに再接続してください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"브라우저 로그인이 만료되었습니다. 이 Gateway에 다시 연결하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La session de connexion dans le navigateur a expiré. Reconnectez ce Gateway."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ब्राउज़र साइन-इन की समय-सीमा समाप्त हो गई है। इस Gateway को फिर से कनेक्ट करें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"انتهت صلاحية تسجيل الدخول عبر المتصفح. أعد الاتصال بـ Gateway هذا."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"L'accesso tramite browser è scaduto. Riconnetti questo Gateway."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tarayıcı oturumunun süresi doldu. Bu Gateway'e yeniden bağlanın."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Термін дії входу через браузер минув. Повторно підключіть цей Gateway."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sesi masuk browser telah kedaluwarsa. Hubungkan kembali Gateway ini."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sesja logowania w przeglądarce wygasła. Połącz się ponownie z tym Gateway."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การลงชื่อเข้าใช้ผ่านเบราว์เซอร์หมดอายุแล้ว โปรดเชื่อมต่อ Gateway นี้อีกครั้ง"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Phiên đăng nhập trên trình duyệt đã hết hạn. Hãy kết nối lại Gateway này."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"De browseraanmelding is verlopen. Maak opnieuw verbinding met deze Gateway."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"نشست ورود در مرورگر منقضی شده است. دوباره به این Gateway متصل شوید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Срок действия авторизации в браузере истёк. Подключитесь к этому Gateway заново."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inloggningen i webbläsaren har gått ut. Anslut till denna Gateway igen."}}}},
    "Bubbling": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bubbling"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"冒泡"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"冒泡"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Borbulhando"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Blubbern"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Burbujeo"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"バブリング"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"버블링"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bouillonnement"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"बुलबुले उठना"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"فقاعات"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gorgoglio"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kabarcıklanma"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Булькання"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bergelembung"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bulg otanie"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ฟองผุด"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sủi bọt"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Borrelen"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"حباب‌زنی"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Бурление"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bubblande"}}}},
