    "Each selected thread and its transcript will be removed from the gateway.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Each selected thread and its transcript will be removed from the gateway."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每个选中的会话及其聊天记录都将从 Gateway 中移除。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每個選取的討論串及其對話記錄都將從 Gateway 移除。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cada conversa selecionada e sua transcrição serão removidas do Gateway."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jeder ausgewählte Thread und sein Transkript werden vom Gateway entfernt."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cada hilo seleccionado y su transcripción se eliminarán del Gateway."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選択した各スレッドとその会話記録がGatewayから削除されます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"선택한 각 스레드와 해당 대화 기록이 Gateway에서 삭제됩니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chaque fil sélectionné et sa transcription seront supprimés du Gateway."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"हर चयनित थ्रेड और उसका प्रतिलेख Gateway से हटा दिया जाएगा."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ستُزال كل محادثة محددة وسجلها النصي من Gateway."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ogni conversazione selezionata e la relativa trascrizione verranno rimosse dal Gateway."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Seçilen her konuşma ve dökümü Gateway'den kaldırılacak."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Кожну вибрану гілку та її розшифровку буде видалено з Gateway."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Setiap utas yang dipilih beserta transkripnya akan dihapus dari Gateway."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Każdy wybrany wątek wraz z transkrypcją zostanie usunięty z bramy."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เธรดที่เลือกแต่ละรายการและบันทึกบทสนทนาของเธรดนั้นจะถูกนำออกจาก Gateway"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mỗi luồng được chọn và bản ghi hội thoại của luồng đó sẽ bị xóa khỏi Gateway."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Elke geselecteerde thread en het bijbehorende transcript worden uit de gateway verwijderd."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"هر رشته‌گفتگوی انتخاب‌شده و متن آن از Gateway حذف خواهد شد."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Каждая выбранная ветка и её история сообщений будут удалены из Gateway."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Varje vald tråd och dess transkript tas bort från Gateway."}}}},
    "Effort": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Effort"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"思考强度"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"投入程度"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Esforço"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aufwand"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Esfuerzo"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"思考量"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"노력 수준"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"Effort"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"प्रयास"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"الجهد"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Impegno"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Çaba"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Зусилля"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Upaya"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wysiłek"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ความพยายาม"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mức độ nỗ lực"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inspanning"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تلاش"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Усилия"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ansträngning"}}}},
    "Enable Voice Wake in Dashboard → Settings → Talk for hands-free commands with a live transcript overlay.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enable Voice Wake in Dashboard → Settings → Talk for hands-free commands with a live transcript overlay."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在仪表盘 → 设置 → 对话中启用语音唤醒，即可免手动发出指令，并在浮层中查看实时转写。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在「儀表板 → 設定 → 語音對話」中啟用語音喚醒，即可透過語音下達指令，並在浮動視窗中查看即時逐字稿。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ative a ativação por voz em Painel → Configurações → Conversa para usar comandos sem as mãos com uma transcrição sobreposta em tempo real."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktivieren Sie die Sprachaktivierung unter Dashboard → Einstellungen → Sprechen, um freihändige Befehle mit eingeblendetem Live-Transkript zu verwenden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activa la activación por voz en Panel → Ajustes → Hablar para usar comandos manos libres con una transcripción superpuesta en tiempo real."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ダッシュボード → 設定 → トークで音声起動を有効にすると、リアルタイムの文字起こしをオーバーレイ表示しながら、ハンズフリーでコマンドを実行できます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"실시간 받아쓰기 오버레이를 보면서 핸즈프리 명령을 사용하려면 대시보드 → 설정 → 대화에서 음성 호출을 활성화하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activez le réveil vocal dans Tableau de bord → Paramètres → Conversation pour utiliser des commandes mains libres avec une transcription en direct en superposition."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"लाइव ट्रांसक्रिप्ट ओवरले के साथ हैंड्स-फ़्री कमांड देने के लिए डैशबोर्ड → सेटिंग्स → बातचीत में आवाज़ से सक्रिय करना चालू करें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"فعّل التنشيط بالصوت في لوحة المعلومات → الإعدادات → التحدث لاستخدام الأوامر دون استخدام اليدين مع طبقة تعرض النص المنسوخ مباشرةً."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Abilita l’attivazione vocale in Pannello di controllo → Impostazioni → Conversazione per usare comandi a mani libere con una trascrizione in tempo reale in sovrimpressione."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Canlı konuşma dökümü katmanıyla eller serbest komutlar vermek için Pano → Ayarlar → Konuşma bölümünde Sesle Uyandırma'yı etkinleştirin."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Увімкніть голосову активацію в розділі Панель керування → Налаштування → Розмова, щоб подавати команди без допомоги рук і бачити їхнє текстове відображення в реальному часі на накладеній панелі."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktifkan Aktivasi Suara di Dasbor → Pengaturan → Bicara untuk menggunakan perintah tanpa tangan dengan hamparan transkrip langsung."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Włącz wybudzanie głosem w sekcji Panel → Ustawienia → Rozmowa, aby wydawać polecenia bez użycia rąk i wyświetlać transkrypcję na żywo w nakładce."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เปิดใช้งานการปลุกด้วยเสียงในแดชบอร์ด → การตั้งค่า → สนทนา เพื่อสั่งงานแบบแฮนด์ฟรีพร้อมข้อความถอดเสียงแบบเรียลไทม์ที่แสดงซ้อนบนหน้าจอ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bật Đánh thức bằng giọng nói trong Bảng điều khiển → Cài đặt → Trò chuyện bằng giọng nói để ra lệnh rảnh tay với lớp phủ hiển thị bản chép lời trực tiếp."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Schakel spraakactivering in via Dashboard → Instellingen → Spraak voor handsfree opdrachten met een overlay die live transcripties toont."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"برای استفاده از فرمان‌های بدون دخالت دست همراه با نمایش شناور متن زندهٔ گفتار، بیدارباش صوتی را در داشبورد → تنظیمات → مکالمه فعال کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Включите голосовую активацию в разделе Панель управления → Настройки → Разговор, чтобы подавать команды без помощи рук и видеть их расшифровку в реальном времени поверх других окон."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktivera röstväckning under Översikt → Inställningar → Tala för handsfree-kommandon med en överlagrad transkription i realtid."}}}},
    "Enable continuous microphone listening?": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enable continuous microphone listening?"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"启用麦克风持续监听吗？"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"啟用麥克風持續聆聽？"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ativar a escuta contínua do microfone?"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontinuierliches Mithören über das Mikrofon aktivieren?"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"¿Activar la escucha continua del micrófono?"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"マイクによる常時リスニングを有効にしますか？"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"마이크로 계속 듣기를 활성화하시겠습니까?"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activer l’écoute continue du microphone ?"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"माइक्रोफ़ोन से लगातार सुनना चालू करें?"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"هل تريد تفعيل الاستماع المستمر عبر الميكروفون؟"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Abilitare l’ascolto continuo del microfono?"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mikrofonun sürekli dinlemesi etkinleştirilsin mi?"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Увімкнути безперервне прослуховування через мікрофон?"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktifkan pendengaran mikrofon secara terus-menerus?"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Włączyć ciągłe nasłuchiwanie przez mikrofon?"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เปิดใช้งานการฟังผ่านไมโครโฟนอย่างต่อเนื่องหรือไม่?"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bật chế độ nghe micrô liên tục?"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continu luisteren via de microfoon inschakelen?"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"گوش‌دادن پیوسته از طریق میکروفون فعال شود؟"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Включить постоянное прослушивание микрофона?"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktivera kontinuerlig mikrofonavlyssning?"}}}},
    "Enable optional skills (Peekaboo, oracle, camsnap, …) from Dashboard → Skills.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enable optional skills (Peekaboo, oracle, camsnap, …) from Dashboard → Skills."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在仪表盘 → Skills 中启用可选技能（Peekaboo、oracle、camsnap、…）。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"從「儀表板 → Skills」啟用選用技能（Peekaboo、oracle、camsnap、…）。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ative habilidades opcionais (Peekaboo, oracle, camsnap, …) em Painel → Skills."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktivieren Sie optionale Skills (Peekaboo, oracle, camsnap, …) unter Dashboard → Skills."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activa las habilidades opcionales (Peekaboo, oracle, camsnap, …) desde Panel → Skills."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ダッシュボード → Skillsから、オプションのスキル（Peekaboo、oracle、camsnap、…）を有効にできます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"대시보드 → Skills에서 선택적 스킬(Peekaboo, oracle, camsnap, …)을 활성화하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activez les compétences facultatives (Peekaboo, oracle, camsnap, …) dans Tableau de bord → Skills."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"डैशबोर्ड → Skills से वैकल्पिक कौशल (Peekaboo, oracle, camsnap, …) चालू करें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"فعّل المهارات الاختيارية (Peekaboo، oracle، camsnap، …) من لوحة المعلومات → Skills."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Abilita le Skills facoltative (Peekaboo, oracle, camsnap, …) da Pannello di controllo → Skills."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"İsteğe bağlı becerileri (Peekaboo, oracle, camsnap, …) Pano → Skills bölümünden etkinleştirin."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Увімкніть додаткові навички (Peekaboo, oracle, camsnap, …) у розділі Панель керування → Skills."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktifkan keterampilan opsional (Peekaboo, oracle, camsnap, …) dari Dasbor → Skills."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Włącz opcjonalne umiejętności (Peekaboo, oracle, camsnap, …) w sekcji Panel → Skills."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เปิดใช้งานทักษะเสริม (Peekaboo, oracle, camsnap, …) จากแดชบอร์ด → Skills"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bật các kỹ năng tùy chọn (Peekaboo, oracle, camsnap, …) từ Bảng điều khiển → Skills."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Schakel optionele Skills (Peekaboo, oracle, camsnap, …) in via Dashboard → Skills."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"مهارت‌های اختیاری (Peekaboo، oracle، camsnap، …) را از داشبورد → Skills فعال کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Включите дополнительные навыки (Peekaboo, oracle, camsnap, …) в разделе Панель управления → Skills."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktivera valfria färdigheter (Peekaboo, oracle, camsnap, …) under Översikt → Skills."}}}},
    "Enable or install a text-inference provider plugin on this Gateway, then check again.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enable or install a text-inference provider plugin on this Gateway, then check again."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在此 Gateway 上启用或安装文本推理提供商插件，然后重新检查。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在此 Gateway 上啟用或安裝文字推論供應商外掛, 然後再次檢查。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ative ou instale um plugin de provedor de inferência de texto neste Gateway e verifique novamente."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktivieren oder installieren Sie ein Plugin für einen Textinferenz-Anbieter auf diesem Gateway und prüfen Sie dann erneut."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activa o instala un complemento de proveedor de inferencia de texto en este Gateway, y vuelve a comprobarlo."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"このGatewayでテキスト推論プロバイダープラグインを有効にするかインストールしてから、もう一度確認してください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 Gateway에서 텍스트 추론 제공업체 플러그인을 활성화하거나 설치한 후 다시 확인하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activez ou installez un plugin de fournisseur d’inférence textuelle sur ce Gateway, puis vérifiez à nouveau."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"इस Gateway पर टेक्स्ट-इन्फ़रेंस प्रदाता प्लगइन सक्षम या इंस्टॉल करें, फिर दोबारा जाँचें."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"قم بتمكين إضافة موفر للاستدلال النصي أو تثبيتها على Gateway هذا، ثم تحقق مرة أخرى."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Abilita o installa un plugin di un provider di inferenza testuale su questo Gateway, quindi verifica di nuovo."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bu Gateway üzerinde bir metin çıkarımı sağlayıcı eklentisini etkinleştirin veya yükleyin, ardından tekrar kontrol edin."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Увімкніть або встановіть плагін постачальника текстового інференсу на цьому Gateway, а потім перевірте ще раз."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktifkan atau instal plugin penyedia inferensi teks di Gateway ini, lalu periksa lagi."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Włącz lub zainstaluj wtyczkę dostawcy inferencji tekstowej na tym Gateway, a następnie sprawdź ponownie."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เปิดใช้งานหรือติดตั้งปลั๊กอินผู้ให้บริการอนุมานข้อความบน Gateway นี้ แล้วตรวจสอบอีกครั้ง."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bật hoặc cài đặt plugin nhà cung cấp suy luận văn bản trên Gateway này, rồi kiểm tra lại."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Schakel een providerplug-in voor tekstinferentie in op deze Gateway of installeer er een, en controleer het vervolgens opnieuw."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"یک افزونهٔ ارائه‌دهندهٔ استنتاج متنی را در این Gateway فعال یا نصب کنید، سپس دوباره بررسی کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Включите или установите плагин провайдера генерации текста на этом Gateway, затем проверьте снова."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktivera eller installera ett leverantörsinsticksprogram för textinferens på denna Gateway och kontrollera sedan igen."}}}},
    "Enable the Peekaboo bridge on this Mac?": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enable the Peekaboo bridge on this Mac?"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在这台 Mac 上启用 Peekaboo 桥接？"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"要在這部 Mac 上啟用 Peekaboo 橋接器嗎？"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ativar a ponte Peekaboo neste Mac?"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Peekaboo-Bridge auf diesem Mac aktivieren?"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"¿Activar el puente de Peekaboo en este Mac?"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"このMacでPeekabooブリッジを有効にしますか？"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 Mac에서 Peekaboo 브리지를 활성화할까요?"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activer le pont Peekaboo sur ce Mac ?"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"इस Mac पर Peekaboo ब्रिज सक्षम करें?"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"هل تريد تفعيل جسر Peekaboo على جهاز Mac هذا؟"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Abilitare il bridge Peekaboo su questo Mac?"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bu Mac'te Peekaboo köprüsü etkinleştirilsin mi?"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Увімкнути міст Peekaboo на цьому Mac?"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktifkan bridge Peekaboo di Mac ini?"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Włączyć most Peekaboo na tym Macu?"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เปิดใช้งานบริดจ์ Peekaboo บน Mac เครื่องนี้หรือไม่?"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bật cầu nối Peekaboo trên máy Mac này?"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"De Peekaboo-bridge inschakelen op deze Mac?"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"پل Peekaboo در این Mac فعال شود؟"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Включить мост Peekaboo на этом Mac?"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktivera Peekaboo-bryggan på den här Mac-datorn?"}}}},
    "Enable/disable Canvas in General settings.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enable/disable Canvas in General settings."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在通用设置中启用/禁用 Canvas。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在一般設定中啟用/停用 Canvas."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ative/desative o Canvas nos ajustes gerais."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Canvas unter „Allgemein“ in den Einstellungen aktivieren/deaktivieren."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activar/desactivar Canvas en los ajustes generales."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一般設定でCanvasを有効/無効にします."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"일반 설정에서 Canvas를 활성화/비활성화하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activer/désactiver Canvas dans les réglages généraux."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सामान्य सेटिंग्स में Canvas सक्षम/अक्षम करें."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تمكين/تعطيل Canvas في الإعدادات العامة."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Abilita/disabilita Canvas nelle impostazioni generali."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Genel ayarlarda Canvas'ı etkinleştirin/devre dışı bırakın."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Увімкніть/вимкніть Canvas у загальних налаштуваннях."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktifkan/nonaktifkan Canvas di pengaturan Umum."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Włącz/wyłącz Canvas w ustawieniach ogólnych."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เปิด/ปิดใช้งาน Canvas ในการตั้งค่าทั่วไป."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bật/tắt Canvas trong cài đặt Chung."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Schakel Canvas in/uit bij Algemene instellingen."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Canvas را در تنظیمات عمومی فعال/غیرفعال کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Включить/отключить Canvas в основных настройках."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktivera/inaktivera Canvas i Allmänna inställningar."}}}},
    "Enabled for this session": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enabled for this session"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已为此会话启用"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已為此工作階段啟用"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ativado para esta sessão"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Für diese Sitzung aktiviert"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activado para esta sesión"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"このセッションで有効"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 세션에서 활성화됨"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activé pour cette session"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"इस सत्र के लिए सक्षम"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"مفعّل لهذه الجلسة"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Abilitato per questa sessione"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bu oturum için etkin"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Увімкнено для цього сеансу"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Diaktifkan untuk sesi ini"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Włączone w tej sesji"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เปิดใช้งานสำหรับเซสชันนี้"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Đã bật cho phiên này"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ingeschakeld voor deze sessie"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"برای این نشست فعال است"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Включено для этого сеанса"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktiverat för den här sessionen"}}}},
    "Enter its address and sign in with your browser.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enter its address and sign in with your browser."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"输入其地址，然后通过浏览器登录。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"輸入其位址，並使用瀏覽器登入。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Digite o endereço e entre pelo navegador."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Geben Sie die Adresse ein und melden Sie sich über Ihren Browser an."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Introduce su dirección e inicia sesión en tu navegador."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"アドレスを入力し、ブラウザでサインインしてください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"주소를 입력하고 브라우저에서 로그인하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saisissez son adresse et connectez-vous dans votre navigateur."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"इसका पता दर्ज करें और अपने ब्राउज़र से साइन इन करें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"أدخل عنوانه وسجّل الدخول باستخدام متصفحك."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inserisci il suo indirizzo e accedi tramite il browser."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Adresini girin ve tarayıcınızla oturum açın."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Введіть його адресу та увійдіть через браузер."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Masukkan alamatnya dan masuk melalui browser Anda."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wprowadź adres i zaloguj się w przeglądarce."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ป้อนที่อยู่และลงชื่อเข้าใช้ผ่านเบราว์เซอร์ของคุณ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nhập địa chỉ của Gateway và đăng nhập bằng trình duyệt."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Voer het adres in en meld je aan via je browser."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"نشانی آن را وارد کنید و از طریق مرورگر خود وارد شوید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Введите его адрес и войдите через браузер."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ange dess adress och logga in via webbläsaren."}}}},
    "Enter the gateway password in the Gateway token field. If needed, configure gateway.auth.password or OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD on the gateway host.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enter the gateway password in the Gateway token field. If needed, configure gateway.auth.password or OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD on the gateway host."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在 Gateway 令牌字段中输入 Gateway 密码。如有需要，请在 Gateway 主机上配置 gateway.auth.password 或 OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在 Gateway 權杖欄位中輸入 Gateway 密碼。如有需要，請在 Gateway 主機上設定 gateway.auth.password 或 OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Insira a senha do Gateway no campo de token do Gateway. Se necessário, configure gateway.auth.password ou OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD no host do Gateway."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Geben Sie das Gateway-Passwort in das Feld für das Gateway-Token ein. Konfigurieren Sie bei Bedarf gateway.auth.password oder OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD auf dem Gateway-Host."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Introduce la contraseña del Gateway en el campo de token del Gateway. Si es necesario, configura gateway.auth.password u OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD en el host del Gateway."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gatewayトークン欄にGatewayのパスワードを入力してください。必要に応じて、Gatewayホストでgateway.auth.passwordまたはOPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORDを設定してください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gateway 토큰 필드에 Gateway 비밀번호를 입력하세요. 필요한 경우 Gateway 호스트에서 gateway.auth.password 또는 OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD를 설정하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saisissez le mot de passe du Gateway dans le champ du jeton Gateway. Si nécessaire, configurez gateway.auth.password ou OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD sur l’hôte du Gateway."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gateway टोकन फ़ील्ड में Gateway का पासवर्ड दर्ज करें। ज़रूरत होने पर, Gateway होस्ट पर gateway.auth.password या OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD कॉन्फ़िगर करें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"أدخل كلمة مرور Gateway في حقل رمز Gateway. إذا لزم الأمر، فاضبط gateway.auth.password أو OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD على مضيف Gateway."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inserisci la password del Gateway nel campo del token del Gateway. Se necessario, configura gateway.auth.password o OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD sull'host del Gateway."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gateway parolasını Gateway belirteci alanına girin. Gerekirse Gateway sunucusunda gateway.auth.password veya OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD ayarını yapılandırın."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Введіть пароль Gateway у поле токена Gateway. За потреби налаштуйте gateway.auth.password або OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD на хості Gateway."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Masukkan kata sandi Gateway di kolom token Gateway. Jika perlu, konfigurasikan gateway.auth.password atau OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD pada host Gateway."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wpisz hasło Gateway w polu tokenu Gateway. W razie potrzeby skonfiguruj gateway.auth.password lub OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD na hoście Gateway."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ป้อนรหัสผ่านของ Gateway ในช่องโทเค็น Gateway หากจำเป็น ให้กำหนดค่า gateway.auth.password หรือ OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD บนโฮสต์ของ Gateway"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nhập mật khẩu Gateway vào trường mã thông báo Gateway. Nếu cần, hãy cấu hình gateway.auth.password hoặc OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD trên máy chủ Gateway."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Voer het wachtwoord van de Gateway in het veld voor het Gateway-token in. Configureer indien nodig gateway.auth.password of OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD op de Gateway-host."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"گذرواژهٔ Gateway را در فیلد توکن Gateway وارد کنید. در صورت نیاز، gateway.auth.password یا OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD را روی میزبان Gateway پیکربندی کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Введите пароль Gateway в поле токена Gateway. При необходимости настройте gateway.auth.password или OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD на хосте Gateway."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ange lösenordet för Gateway i fältet Gateway-token. Konfigurera vid behov gateway.auth.password eller OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD på Gateway-värden."}}}},
    "Enter this one-time code on the provider's sign-in page.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enter this one-time code on the provider's sign-in page."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在提供商的登录页面输入此一次性代码。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在供應商的登入頁面輸入此一次性代碼。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Digite este código de uso único na página de login do provedor."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Geben Sie diesen Einmalcode auf der Anmeldeseite des Anbieters ein."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Introduce este código de un solo uso en la página de inicio de sesión del proveedor."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"プロバイダーのサインインページでこのワンタイムコードを入力してください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"제공업체의 로그인 페이지에 이 일회용 코드를 입력하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saisissez ce code à usage unique sur la page de connexion du fournisseur."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"प्रदाता के साइन-इन पेज पर यह एक बार इस्तेमाल होने वाला कोड दर्ज करें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"أدخل هذا الرمز المخصّص للاستخدام مرة واحدة في صفحة تسجيل الدخول لدى المزوّد."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inserisci questo codice monouso nella pagina di accesso del provider."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bu tek kullanımlık kodu sağlayıcının oturum açma sayfasına girin."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Введіть цей одноразовий код на сторінці входу постачальника."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Masukkan kode sekali pakai ini di halaman masuk penyedia."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wpisz ten jednorazowy kod na stronie logowania dostawcy."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ป้อนรหัสแบบใช้ครั้งเดียวนี้ในหน้าลงชื่อเข้าใช้ของผู้ให้บริการ."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nhập mã dùng một lần này trên trang đăng nhập của nhà cung cấp."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Voer deze eenmalige code in op de aanmeldpagina van de provider."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"این کد یک‌بارمصرف را در صفحهٔ ورود ارائه‌دهنده وارد کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Введите этот одноразовый код на странице входа провайдера."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ange den här engångskoden på leverantörens inloggningssida."}}}},
    "Enter your Gateway address. Sign in through your browser when requested.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enter your Gateway address. Sign in through your browser when requested."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"输入你的 Gateway 地址。出现提示时，通过浏览器登录。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"輸入您的 Gateway 位址。出現提示時，請透過瀏覽器登入。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Digite o endereço do seu Gateway. Entre pelo navegador quando solicitado."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Geben Sie Ihre Gateway-Adresse ein. Melden Sie sich über Ihren Browser an, wenn Sie dazu aufgefordert werden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Introduce la dirección de tu Gateway. Inicia sesión en tu navegador cuando se te solicite."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gatewayのアドレスを入力してください。求められたら、ブラウザでサインインしてください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gateway 주소를 입력하세요. 요청이 표시되면 브라우저에서 로그인하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saisissez l’adresse de votre Gateway. Connectez-vous dans votre navigateur lorsque vous y êtes invité."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"अपने Gateway का पता दर्ज करें। कहे जाने पर अपने ब्राउज़र से साइन इन करें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"أدخل عنوان Gateway. سجّل الدخول عبر متصفحك عند الطلب."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inserisci l'indirizzo del tuo Gateway. Accedi tramite il browser quando richiesto."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gateway adresinizi girin. İstendiğinde tarayıcınız üzerinden oturum açın."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Введіть адресу Gateway. Увійдіть через браузер, коли з’явиться запит."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Masukkan alamat Gateway Anda. Masuk melalui browser saat diminta."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wprowadź adres Gateway. Gdy pojawi się prośba, zaloguj się w przeglądarce."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ป้อนที่อยู่ Gateway ของคุณ ลงชื่อเข้าใช้ผ่านเบราว์เซอร์เมื่อได้รับแจ้ง"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nhập địa chỉ Gateway của bạn. Đăng nhập qua trình duyệt khi được yêu cầu."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Voer je Gateway-adres in. Meld je aan via je browser wanneer daarom wordt gevraagd."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"نشانی Gateway خود را وارد کنید. هرگاه از شما خواسته شد، از طریق مرورگر خود وارد شوید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Введите адрес Gateway. Войдите через браузер, когда появится запрос."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ange adressen till din Gateway. Logga in via webbläsaren när du blir ombedd."}}}},
    "Error": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Error"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"错误"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"錯誤"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Erro"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fehler"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"Error"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"エラー"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"오류"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Erreur"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"त्रुटि"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"خطأ"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Errore"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hata"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Помилка"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kesalahan"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Błąd"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ข้อผิดพลาด"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lỗi"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fout"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"خطا"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ошибка"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fel"}}}},
    "Error: %@": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Error: %@"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"错误: %@"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"錯誤: %@"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Erro: %@"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fehler: %@"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"Error: %@"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"エラー: %@"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"오류: %@"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Erreur : %@"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"त्रुटि: %@"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"خطأ: %@"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Errore: %@"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hata: %@"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Помилка: %@"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kesalahan: %@"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Błąd: %@"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ข้อผิดพลาด: %@"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lỗi: %@"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fout: %@"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"خطا: %@"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ошибка: %@"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fel: %@"}}}},
    "Everything runs where you decide, with permissions you grant.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Everything runs where you decide, with permissions you grant."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一切都在您指定的位置运行，并使用您授予的权限。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所有功能都在您指定的位置執行, 並使用您授予的權限。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tudo é executado onde você decide, com as permissões que você concede."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alles läuft dort, wo Sie es festlegen, mit den Berechtigungen, die Sie erteilen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Todo se ejecuta donde tú decidas, con los permisos que concedas."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"すべての処理は、指定した場所で、付与した権限に基づいて実行されます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"모든 작업은 사용자가 지정한 위치에서 부여한 권한으로 실행됩니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tout s’exécute là où vous le décidez, avec les autorisations que vous accordez."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सब कुछ आपके तय किए गए स्थान पर, आपकी दी गई अनुमतियों के साथ चलता है।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يعمل كل شيء حيثما تختار، وبالأذونات التي تمنحها."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tutto viene eseguito dove decidi tu, con le autorizzazioni che concedi."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Her şey sizin belirlediğiniz yerde, verdiğiniz izinlerle çalışır."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Усе працює там, де ви вирішите, з дозволами, які ви надасте."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Semuanya berjalan di tempat yang Anda tentukan, dengan izin yang Anda berikan."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wszystko działa tam, gdzie zdecydujesz, z uprawnieniami, których udzielisz."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ทุกอย่างทำงานในที่ที่คุณเลือก โดยใช้สิทธิ์ที่คุณอนุญาต."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mọi thứ chạy ở nơi bạn chọn, với các quyền bạn cấp."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alles draait waar jij dat bepaalt, met de machtigingen die jij verleent."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"همه‌چیز در جایی که شما تعیین می‌کنید و با مجوزهایی که شما می‌دهید اجرا می‌شود."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Всё выполняется там, где вы решите, с разрешениями, которые вы предоставите."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Allt körs där du bestämmer, med de behörigheter du beviljar."}}}},
    "Exact HTTPS hosts, separated by commas or spaces. Empty allows config SecretRefs only.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exact HTTPS hosts, separated by commas or spaces. Empty allows config SecretRefs only."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"精确的 HTTPS 主机名，以逗号或空格分隔。留空则仅允许配置中的 SecretRefs。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"須完全符合的 HTTPS 主機, 以逗號或空格分隔。 留空時僅允許設定中的 SecretRefs."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hosts HTTPS exatos, separados por vírgulas ou espaços. Se estiver vazio, permite apenas SecretRefs da configuração."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exakte HTTPS-Hosts, durch Kommas oder Leerzeichen getrennt. Ein leeres Feld erlaubt nur SecretRefs aus der Konfiguration."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hosts HTTPS exactos, separados por comas o espacios. Si se deja vacío, solo se permiten SecretRefs de la configuración."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"完全一致するHTTPSホストをカンマまたはスペースで区切って指定します。空の場合は設定内のSecretRefsのみが許可されます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"정확한 HTTPS 호스트를 쉼표나 공백으로 구분하여 입력하세요. 비워 두면 구성의 SecretRefs만 허용됩니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Noms d’hôtes HTTPS exacts, séparés par des virgules ou des espaces. Si ce champ est vide, seuls les SecretRefs de la configuration sont autorisés."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सटीक HTTPS होस्ट, अल्पविराम या स्पेस से अलग किए गए। खाली होने पर केवल कॉन्फ़िगरेशन के SecretRefs की अनुमति है।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"أسماء مضيفي HTTPS الدقيقة، مفصولة بفواصل أو مسافات. ترك الحقل فارغًا يسمح فقط باستخدام SecretRefs في الإعدادات."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Host HTTPS esatti, separati da virgole o spazi. Se vuoto, consente solo i SecretRefs della configurazione."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Virgül veya boşlukla ayrılmış tam HTTPS ana makine adları. Boş bırakılırsa yalnızca yapılandırmadaki SecretRefs değerlerine izin verilir."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Точні імена хостів HTTPS, розділені комами або пробілами. Порожнє поле дозволяє лише SecretRefs із конфігурації."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Host HTTPS yang harus cocok persis, dipisahkan dengan koma atau spasi. Jika kosong, hanya SecretRefs konfigurasi yang diizinkan."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dokładne nazwy hostów HTTPS, oddzielone przecinkami lub spacjami. Puste pole zezwala tylko na SecretRefs z konfiguracji."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ระบุโฮสต์ HTTPS ให้ตรงทุกตัวอักษร โดยคั่นด้วยจุลภาคหรือเว้นวรรค. หากเว้นว่างไว้ จะอนุญาตเฉพาะ SecretRefs ในการกำหนดค่าเท่านั้น."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tên máy chủ HTTPS chính xác, phân tách bằng dấu phẩy hoặc dấu cách. Để trống thì chỉ cho phép SecretRefs trong cấu hình."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exacte HTTPS-hosts, gescheiden door komma's of spaties. Als dit leeg is, zijn alleen SecretRefs uit de configuratie toegestaan."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"نام دقیق میزبان‌های HTTPS، جداشده با ویرگول یا فاصله. خالی گذاشتن این بخش فقط SecretRefs پیکربندی را مجاز می‌کند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Точные имена HTTPS-хостов, разделённые запятыми или пробелами. Если поле пустое, разрешены только SecretRefs из конфигурации."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exakta HTTPS-värdar, avgränsade med kommatecken eller mellanslag. Tomt tillåter endast SecretRefs från konfigurationen."}}}},
