    "Importing browser cookies…": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Importing browser cookies…"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在导入浏览器 Cookie…"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在匯入瀏覽器 Cookie…"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Importando cookies do navegador…"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Browser-Cookies werden importiert…"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Importando cookies del navegador…"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ブラウザのCookieをインポート中…"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"브라우저 쿠키 가져오는 중…"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Importation des cookies du navigateur…"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ब्राउज़र कुकीज़ आयात की जा रही हैं…"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"جارٍ استيراد ملفات تعريف الارتباط من المتصفح…"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Importazione dei cookie del browser…"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tarayıcı çerezleri içe aktarılıyor…"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Імпортування файлів cookie браузера…"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mengimpor cookie browser…"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Importowanie plików cookie przeglądarki…"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"กำลังนำเข้าคุกกี้ของเบราว์เซอร์…"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Đang nhập cookie trình duyệt…"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Browsercookies importeren…"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"در حال وارد کردن کوکی‌های مرورگر…"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Импорт файлов cookie браузера…"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Importerar webbläsarkakor…"}}}},
    "Include existing %@ conversations in the sidebar. This discovers them in place; it does not copy transcripts.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Include existing %@ conversations in the sidebar. This discovers them in place; it does not copy transcripts."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在侧边栏中显示现有的 %@ 对话。此操作会在原位置发现这些对话，不会复制对话记录。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在側邊欄中顯示現有的 %@ 對話。此功能會在原位置尋找對話，不會複製對話記錄。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inclua as conversas existentes de %@ na barra lateral. Isso localiza as conversas onde estão, sem copiar as transcrições."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vorhandene %@-Unterhaltungen in der Seitenleiste anzeigen. Sie werden an ihrem bestehenden Speicherort erkannt; Gesprächsverläufe werden nicht kopiert."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Incluye las conversaciones existentes de %@ en la barra lateral. Se detectan en su ubicación original; no se copian las transcripciones."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"既存の%@の会話をサイドバーに表示します。会話は元の場所で検出され、会話履歴はコピーされません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"기존 %@ 대화를 사이드바에 포함합니다. 대화는 원래 위치에서 검색하며, 대화 기록은 복사하지 않습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inclure les conversations %@ existantes dans la barre latérale. Elles sont détectées à leur emplacement actuel ; leur contenu n’est pas copié."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"मौजूदा %@ वार्तालापों को साइडबार में शामिल करें। यह उन्हें उनके मौजूदा स्थान पर ही खोजता है; उनके प्रतिलेखों की प्रतिलिपि नहीं बनाता।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تضمين محادثات %@ الموجودة في الشريط الجانبي. يكتشفها هذا الخيار في مكانها، ولا ينسخ سجلات المحادثات."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Includi le conversazioni esistenti di %@ nella barra laterale. Verranno individuate nella loro posizione originale, senza copiarne le trascrizioni."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mevcut %@ konuşmalarını kenar çubuğuna dahil edin. Bu işlem, konuşmaları bulundukları yerde tespit eder; konuşma dökümlerini kopyalamaz."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Показувати наявні розмови %@ на бічній панелі. Вони виявляються там, де зберігаються; історія розмов не копіюється."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sertakan percakapan %@ yang sudah ada di bilah samping. Percakapan ditemukan di lokasi aslinya; transkrip tidak disalin."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uwzględnij istniejące rozmowy z %@ na pasku bocznym. Rozmowy są wykrywane w ich obecnej lokalizacji; ich transkrypcje nie są kopiowane."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"แสดงบทสนทนา %@ ที่มีอยู่แล้วในแถบด้านข้าง โดยค้นหาบทสนทนาจากตำแหน่งเดิม ไม่ได้คัดลอกบันทึกบทสนทนา"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hiển thị các cuộc trò chuyện %@ hiện có trong thanh bên. Các cuộc trò chuyện được tìm ngay tại nơi lưu trữ; nội dung trò chuyện không được sao chép."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Toon bestaande gesprekken van %@ in de zijbalk. Ze worden op hun huidige locatie gevonden; er worden geen gespreksverslagen gekopieerd."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"گفتگوهای موجود %@ را در نوار کناری نمایش دهید. این کار آن‌ها را در محل فعلی‌شان شناسایی می‌کند و متن گفتگوها را کپی نمی‌کند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Показывать существующие беседы %@ на боковой панели. Они будут найдены в исходном расположении; история переписки не копируется."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inkludera befintliga konversationer från %@ i sidofältet. De hittas där de finns; inga konversationsutskrifter kopieras."}}}},
