    "More preview…": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"More preview…"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更多预览…"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更多預覽…"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mais prévia…"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mehr Vorschau…"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Más vista previa…"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"さらにプレビュー…"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"미리보기 더 보기…"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aperçu étendu…"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"और पूर्वावलोकन…"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"المزيد من المعاينة…"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Anteprima estesa…"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Daha fazla önizleme…"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Більше для попереднього перегляду…"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pratinjau lainnya…"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Więcej podglądu…"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ดูตัวอย่างเพิ่มเติม…"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Xem trước thêm…"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Meer voorvertonen…"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"پیش‌نمایش بیشتر…"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Больше предпросмотра…"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mer förhandsvisning…"}}}},
    "More sign-in options": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"More sign-in options"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更多登录选项"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更多登入選項"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mais opções de login"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Weitere Anmeldeoptionen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Más opciones de inicio de sesión"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"その他のサインインオプション"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"다른 로그인 옵션"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Autres options de connexion"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"साइन-इन के और विकल्प"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"المزيد من خيارات تسجيل الدخول"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Altre opzioni di accesso"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Diğer oturum açma seçenekleri"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Інші способи входу"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Opsi masuk lainnya"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Więcej opcji logowania"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ตัวเลือกการลงชื่อเข้าใช้เพิ่มเติม"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tùy chọn đăng nhập khác"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Meer aanmeldopties"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"گزینه‌های بیشتر برای ورود"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Другие способы входа"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fler inloggningsalternativ"}}}},
    "Most people pick this Mac — OpenClaw installs everything and keeps it running in the background. You can change this anytime in Settings.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Most people pick this Mac — OpenClaw installs everything and keeps it running in the background. You can change this anytime in Settings."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"大多数人会选择这台 Mac — OpenClaw 会安装所有组件并使其在后台持续运行。你可以随时在设置中更改此选项。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"大多數人會選擇這部 Mac — OpenClaw 會安裝所有必要元件，並讓它們持續在背景執行。您隨時可以在「設定」中變更此選項。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A maioria das pessoas escolhe este Mac — o OpenClaw instala tudo e mantém tudo em execução em segundo plano. Você pode alterar isso a qualquer momento nos Ajustes."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die meisten wählen diesen Mac — OpenClaw installiert alles und hält es im Hintergrund am Laufen. Sie können dies jederzeit in den Einstellungen ändern."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La mayoría elige este Mac — OpenClaw instala todo y lo mantiene en ejecución en segundo plano. Puedes cambiarlo en cualquier momento en Ajustes."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"多くのユーザーはこのMacを選択します — OpenClawがすべてをインストールし、バックグラウンドで実行し続けます。この設定は「設定」でいつでも変更できます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"대부분의 사용자는 이 Mac을 선택합니다 — OpenClaw가 모든 구성 요소를 설치하고 백그라운드에서 계속 실행되도록 합니다. 설정에서 언제든지 변경할 수 있습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La plupart des utilisateurs choisissent ce Mac — OpenClaw installe tout et assure le fonctionnement en arrière-plan. Vous pouvez modifier ce choix à tout moment dans les réglages."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ज़्यादातर लोग इस Mac को चुनते हैं — OpenClaw सब कुछ इंस्टॉल करता है और उसे बैकग्राउंड में चालू रखता है। आप इसे सेटिंग्स में कभी भी बदल सकते हैं।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يختار معظم الأشخاص جهاز Mac هذا — يثبّت OpenClaw كل شيء ويبقيه قيد التشغيل في الخلفية. يمكنك تغيير هذا في أي وقت من الإعدادات."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La maggior parte delle persone sceglie questo Mac — OpenClaw installa tutto e lo mantiene in esecuzione in background. Puoi modificare questa scelta in qualsiasi momento nelle Impostazioni."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Çoğu kişi bu Mac’i seçiyor — OpenClaw her şeyi yükler ve arka planda çalışır durumda tutar. Bunu istediğiniz zaman Ayarlar’dan değiştirebilirsiniz."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Більшість користувачів обирають цей Mac — OpenClaw встановлює все необхідне й підтримує роботу у фоновому режимі. Ви можете будь-коли змінити це в налаштуваннях."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kebanyakan orang memilih Mac ini — OpenClaw menginstal semuanya dan menjaganya tetap berjalan di latar belakang. Anda dapat mengubahnya kapan saja di Pengaturan."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Większość osób wybiera tego Maca — OpenClaw instaluje wszystko i utrzymuje działanie w tle. Możesz to zmienić w dowolnym momencie w Ustawieniach."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"คนส่วนใหญ่เลือก Mac เครื่องนี้ — OpenClaw จะติดตั้งทุกอย่างและทำงานต่อเนื่องในเบื้องหลัง คุณสามารถเปลี่ยนตัวเลือกนี้ได้ทุกเมื่อในการตั้งค่า"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hầu hết mọi người chọn máy Mac này — OpenClaw cài đặt mọi thứ và duy trì hoạt động trong nền. Bạn có thể thay đổi lựa chọn này bất cứ lúc nào trong Cài đặt."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"De meeste mensen kiezen deze Mac — OpenClaw installeert alles en houdt het op de achtergrond actief. Je kunt dit op elk moment wijzigen in Instellingen."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"بیشتر افراد این Mac را انتخاب می‌کنند — OpenClaw همه‌چیز را نصب می‌کند و در پس‌زمینه در حال اجرا نگه می‌دارد. هر زمان می‌توانید این گزینه را در تنظیمات تغییر دهید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Большинство выбирает этот Mac — OpenClaw устанавливает всё необходимое и поддерживает работу в фоновом режиме. Вы можете изменить это в любой момент в Настройках."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"De flesta väljer den här Mac-datorn — OpenClaw installerar allt och håller det igång i bakgrunden. Du kan ändra detta när som helst i Inställningar."}}}},
