    "Note: macOS may require restarting OpenClaw after enabling Accessibility or Screen Recording.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Note: macOS may require restarting OpenClaw after enabling Accessibility or Screen Recording."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"注意: 启用辅助功能或屏幕录制后, macOS 可能需要重启 OpenClaw."}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"注意: 啟用輔助使用或螢幕錄製後，macOS 可能需要重新啟動 OpenClaw."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Observação: o macOS pode exigir a reinicialização do OpenClaw após habilitar Acessibilidade ou Gravação de Tela."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hinweis: Unter macOS muss OpenClaw nach dem Aktivieren von Bedienungshilfen oder Bildschirmaufnahme möglicherweise neu gestartet werden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nota: macOS puede requerir que reinicies OpenClaw después de habilitar Accesibilidad o Grabación de pantalla."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"注: macOS では、アクセシビリティまたは画面収録を有効にした後、OpenClaw の再起動が必要になる場合があります。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"참고: macOS에서 손쉬운 사용 또는 화면 기록을 활성화한 후 OpenClaw를 재시작해야 할 수 있습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Remarque: macOS peut nécessiter un redémarrage d’OpenClaw après l’activation de l’accessibilité ou de l’enregistrement de l’écran."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"नोट: सुलभता या स्क्रीन रिकॉर्डिंग सक्षम करने के बाद macOS में OpenClaw को फिर से शुरू करना पड़ सकता है."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ملاحظة: قد يتطلب macOS إعادة تشغيل OpenClaw بعد تمكين تسهيلات الاستخدام أو تسجيل الشاشة."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nota: macOS potrebbe richiedere il riavvio di OpenClaw dopo aver abilitato Accessibilità o Registrazione schermo."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Not: macOS, Erişilebilirlik veya Ekran Kaydı etkinleştirildikten sonra OpenClaw uygulamasının yeniden başlatılmasını gerektirebilir."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Примітка: macOS може потребувати перезапуску OpenClaw після ввімкнення спеціальних можливостей або запису екрана."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Catatan: macOS mungkin mengharuskan Anda memulai ulang OpenClaw setelah mengaktifkan Aksesibilitas atau Perekaman Layar."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uwaga: macOS może wymagać ponownego uruchomienia OpenClaw po włączeniu uprawnień dostępu do funkcji dostępności lub nagrywania ekranu."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"หมายเหตุ: macOS อาจต้องให้เริ่ม OpenClaw ใหม่หลังจากเปิดใช้งานการช่วยการเข้าถึงหรือการบันทึกหน้าจอ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lưu ý: macOS có thể yêu cầu khởi động lại OpenClaw sau khi bật Trợ năng hoặc Ghi màn hình."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Opmerking: macOS vereist mogelijk dat OpenClaw opnieuw wordt gestart nadat Toegankelijkheid of Schermopname is ingeschakeld."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"توجه: در macOS ممکن است پس از فعال کردن دسترس‌پذیری یا ضبط صفحه، لازم باشد OpenClaw را دوباره راه‌اندازی کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Примечание: macOS может потребовать перезапуска OpenClaw после включения универсального доступа или записи экрана."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Obs: macOS kan kräva att OpenClaw startas om efter att Hjälpmedel eller Skärminspelning har aktiverats."}}}},
    "Notice": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Notice"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"提示"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"通知"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aviso"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hinweis"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aviso"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"お知らせ"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"안내"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Avis"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सूचना"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تنبيه"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Avviso"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Duyuru"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Примітка"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pemberitahuan"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Informacja"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ประกาศ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Thông báo"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mededeling"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"اطلاعیه"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Уведомление"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Meddelande"}}}},
    "OK": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OK"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"好"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"好"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"OK"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"OK"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aceptar"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"OK"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"확인"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"OK"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ठीक है"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"موافق"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"OK"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tamam"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ОК"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"OK"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"OK"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ตกลง"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"OK"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"OK"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تأیید"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ОК"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"OK"}}}},
    "OK — OpenClaw won’t start anything yet. Pick Local or Remote later in the Connection window.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OK — OpenClaw won’t start anything yet. Pick Local or Remote later in the Connection window."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"好的，OpenClaw 暂时不会启动任何服务。稍后可在“连接”窗口中选择“本地”或“远程”。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"好的，OpenClaw 目前不會啟動任何項目。稍後可在「連線」視窗中選擇「本機」或「遠端」。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OK — o OpenClaw ainda não iniciará nada. Escolha Local ou Remoto mais tarde na janela Conexão."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OK — OpenClaw startet vorerst nichts. Wählen Sie später im Fenster „Verbindung“ die Option „Lokal“ oder „Remote“."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"De acuerdo — OpenClaw no iniciará nada todavía. Elige Local o Remoto más adelante en la ventana Conexión."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"了解しました。OpenClawはまだ何も起動しません。後で接続ウインドウからローカルまたはリモートを選択してください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"알겠습니다. OpenClaw는 아직 아무것도 시작하지 않습니다. 나중에 연결 창에서 로컬 또는 원격을 선택하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OK — OpenClaw ne démarrera rien pour le moment. Choisissez Local ou Distant plus tard dans la fenêtre Connexion."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ठीक है — OpenClaw अभी कुछ भी शुरू नहीं करेगा। बाद में कनेक्शन विंडो में स्थानीय या रिमोट चुनें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"حسنًا — لن يبدأ OpenClaw أي شيء بعد. اختر «محلي» أو «عن بُعد» لاحقًا في نافذة الاتصال."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OK — OpenClaw non avvierà ancora nulla. Scegli Locale o Remoto più tardi nella finestra Connessione."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tamam — OpenClaw henüz hiçbir şey başlatmayacak. Daha sonra Bağlantı penceresinde Yerel veya Uzak seçeneğini belirleyin."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Гаразд — OpenClaw поки нічого не запускатиме. Пізніше виберіть «Локальне» або «Віддалене» у вікні «Підключення»."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Oke — OpenClaw belum akan menjalankan apa pun. Pilih Lokal atau Jarak Jauh nanti di jendela Koneksi."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OK — OpenClaw jeszcze niczego nie uruchomi. Później wybierz opcję Lokalne lub Zdalne w oknie Połączenie."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ตกลง — OpenClaw จะยังไม่เริ่มทำงานใดๆ เลือกในเครื่องหรือระยะไกลได้ภายหลังในหน้าต่างการเชื่อมต่อ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OK — OpenClaw chưa khởi chạy bất kỳ thứ gì. Bạn có thể chọn Cục bộ hoặc Từ xa sau trong cửa sổ Kết nối."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OK — OpenClaw start nog niets. Kies later Lokaal of Extern in het venster Verbinding."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"بسیار خوب — OpenClaw فعلاً چیزی را راه‌اندازی نمی‌کند. بعداً در پنجرهٔ اتصال، گزینهٔ محلی یا راه دور را انتخاب کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Хорошо — OpenClaw пока ничего не запустит. Позже выберите «Локальное» или «Удалённое» в окне «Подключение»."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OK — OpenClaw startar inget ännu. Välj Lokalt eller Fjärranslutning senare i fönstret Anslutning."}}}},
    "Off": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Off"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"关闭"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"關閉"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Desativado"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aus"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Desactivado"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"オフ"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"끔"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Désactivé"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"बंद"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"معطّل"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Disattivato"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kapalı"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вимкнено"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nonaktif"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wył."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ปิด"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tắt"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uit"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"خاموش"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Выкл."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Av"}}}},
    "On": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"On"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"开启"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開啟"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ativado"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ein"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activado"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"オン"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"켜짐"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activé"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"चालू"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"مفعّل"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Attivato"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Açık"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Увімкнено"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktif"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Włączone"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เปิด"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bật"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aan"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"روشن"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вкл."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"På"}}}},
    "On another computer": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"On another computer"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在另一台电脑上"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在另一台電腦上"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Em outro computador"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Auf einem anderen Computer"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"En otro equipo"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"別のコンピュータ上"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"다른 컴퓨터에서"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sur un autre ordinateur"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"किसी अन्य कंप्यूटर पर"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"على كمبيوتر آخر"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Su un altro computer"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Başka bir bilgisayarda"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"На іншому комп’ютері"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Di komputer lain"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Na innym komputerze"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"บนคอมพิวเตอร์เครื่องอื่น"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Trên máy tính khác"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Op een andere computer"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"روی رایانه‌ای دیگر"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"На другом компьютере"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"På en annan dator"}}}},
    "On the gateway host, run `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` in an interactive terminal, then replace the token and try again.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"On the gateway host, run `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` in an interactive terminal, then replace the token and try again."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在网关主机的交互式终端中运行 `openclaw gateway auth-token --show`，然后替换令牌并重试。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在 Gateway 主機的互動式終端機中執行 `openclaw gateway auth-token --show`，然後替換權杖並重試。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No host do Gateway, execute `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` em um terminal interativo, depois substitua o token e tente novamente."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Führen Sie auf dem Gateway-Host `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` in einem interaktiven Terminal aus, ersetzen Sie dann das Token und versuchen Sie es erneut."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"En el equipo donde se ejecuta el Gateway, ejecuta `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` en una terminal interactiva, luego reemplaza el token e inténtalo de nuevo."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gatewayホストの対話型ターミナルで `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` を実行し、トークンを置き換えてから再試行してください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gateway 호스트의 대화형 터미널에서 `openclaw gateway auth-token --show`를 실행한 다음, 토큰을 교체하고 다시 시도하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sur l’hôte du Gateway, exécutez `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` dans un terminal interactif, puis remplacez le jeton et réessayez."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gateway होस्ट पर, इंटरैक्टिव टर्मिनल में `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` चलाएँ, फिर टोकन बदलें और दोबारा प्रयास करें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"على مضيف Gateway، شغّل `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` في طرفية تفاعلية، ثم استبدل الرمز وحاول مرة أخرى."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sull’host del gateway, esegui `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` in un terminale interattivo, poi sostituisci il token e riprova."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gateway sunucusunda, etkileşimli bir terminalde `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` komutunu çalıştırın, ardından belirteci değiştirip tekrar deneyin."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"На хості Gateway виконайте `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` в інтерактивному терміналі, потім замініть токен і спробуйте ще раз."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Di host gateway, jalankan `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` di terminal interaktif, lalu ganti token dan coba lagi."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Na hoście gateway uruchom `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` w interaktywnym terminalu, a następnie zastąp token i spróbuj ponownie."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"บนโฮสต์ของ Gateway ให้เรียกใช้ `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` ในเทอร์มินัลแบบโต้ตอบ จากนั้นแทนที่โทเค็นแล้วลองอีกครั้ง"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Trên máy chủ gateway, chạy `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` trong terminal tương tác, sau đó thay token và thử lại."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Voer op de gatewayhost `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` uit in een interactieve terminal, vervang vervolgens het token en probeer het opnieuw."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"روی میزبان Gateway، فرمان `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` را در یک ترمینال تعاملی اجرا کنید، سپس توکن را جایگزین کنید و دوباره تلاش کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"На хосте Gateway выполните `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` в интерактивном терминале, затем замените токен и повторите попытку."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kör `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` i en interaktiv terminal på gateway-värden, ersätt sedan token och försök igen."}}}},
    "On this Mac": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"On this Mac"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在这台 Mac 上"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在這台 Mac 上"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Neste Mac"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Auf diesem Mac"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"En este Mac"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"このMac上"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 Mac에서"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sur ce Mac"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"इस Mac पर"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"على جهاز Mac هذا"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Su questo Mac"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bu Mac’te"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"На цьому Mac"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Di Mac ini"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Na tym Macu"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"บน Mac เครื่องนี้"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Trên máy Mac này"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Op deze Mac"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"روی این Mac"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"На этом Mac"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"På denna Mac"}}}},
    "Once the service answers, you’ll connect your AI.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Once the service answers, you’ll connect your AI."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"服务响应后，即可连接你的 AI。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"服務回應後，您就可以連接您的 AI。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Assim que o serviço responder, você conectará sua IA."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sobald der Dienst antwortet, verbinden Sie Ihre KI."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Una vez que el servicio responda, conectarás tu IA."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"サービスが応答したら、AIを接続します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"서비스가 응답하면 AI를 연결하게 됩니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Une fois que le service répondra, vous pourrez connecter votre IA."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सेवा से जवाब मिलने के बाद, आप अपना AI कनेक्ट करेंगे।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"بمجرد استجابة الخدمة، ستتمكن من توصيل الذكاء الاصطناعي الخاص بك."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Una volta che il servizio risponde, potrai collegare la tua IA."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hizmet yanıt verdiğinde yapay zekanızı bağlayacaksınız."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Щойно служба відповість, ви підключите свій ШІ."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Setelah layanan merespons, Anda akan menghubungkan AI Anda."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gdy usługa odpowie, połączysz swoją AI."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เมื่อบริการตอบสนองแล้ว คุณจะเชื่อมต่อ AI ของคุณได้"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Khi dịch vụ phản hồi, bạn sẽ kết nối AI của mình."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zodra de service reageert, verbind je je AI."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"پس از پاسخ‌گویی سرویس، هوش مصنوعی خود را متصل خواهید کرد."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Как только сервис ответит, вы сможете подключить свой ИИ."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"När tjänsten svarar ansluter du din AI."}}}},
    "Only image and video attachments are supported right now": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only image and video attachments are supported right now"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前仅支持图片和视频附件"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前僅支援圖片和影片附件"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No momento, apenas anexos de imagem e vídeo são compatíveis"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Derzeit werden nur Bild- und Videoanhänge unterstützt"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Por ahora solo se admiten imágenes y vídeos adjuntos"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"現在、添付ファイルは画像と動画のみ対応しています"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"현재 이미지 및 동영상 첨부 파일만 지원됩니다"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Seules les pièces jointes de type image et vidéo sont prises en charge pour le moment"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"अभी केवल इमेज और वीडियो अटैचमेंट समर्थित हैं"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"لا تُدعم حاليًا سوى مرفقات الصور والفيديو"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Al momento sono supportati solo allegati di immagini e video"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Şu anda yalnızca resim ve video ekleri destekleniyor"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Наразі підтримуються лише вкладення із зображеннями та відео"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saat ini hanya lampiran gambar dan video yang didukung"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Obecnie obsługiwane są tylko załączniki w postaci obrazów i filmów"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ขณะนี้รองรับเฉพาะไฟล์แนบรูปภาพและวิดีโอ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hiện chỉ hỗ trợ tệp đính kèm hình ảnh và video"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Momenteel worden alleen afbeeldings- en videobijlagen ondersteund"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"در حال حاضر فقط پیوست‌های تصویری و ویدیویی پشتیبانی می‌شوند"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сейчас поддерживаются только вложения с изображениями и видео"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Endast bild- och videobilagor stöds just nu"}}}},
    "Only image attachments are supported right now": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only image attachments are supported right now"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前仅支持图片附件"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前僅支援圖片附件"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No momento, apenas anexos de imagem são compatíveis"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Derzeit werden nur Bildanhänge unterstützt"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Por ahora solo se admiten imágenes adjuntas"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"現在、添付ファイルは画像のみ対応しています"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"현재 이미지 첨부 파일만 지원됩니다"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Seules les pièces jointes de type image sont prises en charge pour le moment"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"अभी केवल इमेज अटैचमेंट समर्थित हैं"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"لا تُدعم حاليًا سوى مرفقات الصور"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Al momento sono supportati solo allegati di immagini"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Şu anda yalnızca resim ekleri destekleniyor"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Наразі підтримуються лише вкладення із зображеннями"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saat ini hanya lampiran gambar yang didukung"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Obecnie obsługiwane są tylko załączniki w postaci obrazów"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ขณะนี้รองรับเฉพาะไฟล์แนบรูปภาพ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hiện chỉ hỗ trợ tệp đính kèm hình ảnh"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Momenteel worden alleen afbeeldingsbijlagen ondersteund"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"در حال حاضر فقط پیوست‌های تصویری پشتیبانی می‌شوند"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сейчас поддерживаются только вложения с изображениями"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Endast bildbilagor stöds just nu"}}}},
    "Only needed when the gateway requires token or password auth.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only needed when the gateway requires token or password auth."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅当 Gateway 要求令牌或密码认证时才需要。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"僅在 Gateway 需要權杖或密碼驗證時才需要。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Necessário apenas quando o Gateway exige autenticação por token ou senha."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nur erforderlich, wenn das Gateway eine Authentifizierung per Token oder Passwort verlangt."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Solo es necesario cuando el Gateway requiere autenticación mediante token o contraseña."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gatewayがトークン認証またはパスワード認証を要求する場合にのみ必要です。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gateway에서 토큰 또는 비밀번호 인증을 요구하는 경우에만 필요합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nécessaire uniquement si le Gateway exige une authentification par jeton ou par mot de passe."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"केवल तभी ज़रूरी है जब Gateway को टोकन या पासवर्ड से प्रमाणीकरण की आवश्यकता हो।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"مطلوب فقط عندما يتطلب Gateway المصادقة برمز أو كلمة مرور."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Necessario solo quando il Gateway richiede l'autenticazione tramite token o password."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yalnızca Gateway, belirteç veya parola ile kimlik doğrulaması gerektiriyorsa gereklidir."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Потрібно, лише якщо Gateway вимагає автентифікації за токеном або паролем."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hanya diperlukan jika Gateway mewajibkan autentikasi token atau kata sandi."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wymagane tylko wtedy, gdy Gateway wymaga uwierzytelniania tokenem lub hasłem."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"จำเป็นเฉพาะเมื่อ Gateway ต้องใช้โทเค็นหรือรหัสผ่านเพื่อยืนยันตัวตน"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chỉ cần thiết khi Gateway yêu cầu xác thực bằng mã thông báo hoặc mật khẩu."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alleen nodig als de Gateway authenticatie met een token of wachtwoord vereist."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"فقط زمانی لازم است که Gateway به احراز هویت با توکن یا گذرواژه نیاز داشته باشد."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Требуется только в том случае, если Gateway использует аутентификацию по токену или паролю."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Behövs endast när Gateway kräver autentisering med token eller lösenord."}}}},
