    "Voice Wake will continuously listen for wake phrases through this Mac's microphone.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Voice Wake will continuously listen for wake phrases through this Mac's microphone."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"语音唤醒将通过这台 Mac 的麦克风持续监听唤醒词。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"語音喚醒功能會透過這部 Mac 的麥克風持續聆聽喚醒詞。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A ativação por voz escutará continuamente frases de ativação pelo microfone deste Mac."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die Sprachaktivierung hört kontinuierlich über das Mikrofon dieses Mac auf Aktivierungsphrasen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La activación por voz escuchará continuamente frases de activación a través del micrófono de este Mac."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"音声起動は、このMacのマイクを通じて起動フレーズを常時聞き取ります。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"음성 호출 기능은 이 Mac의 마이크를 통해 호출 문구를 지속적으로 감지합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"L’activation vocale écoutera en continu les phrases d’activation via le microphone de ce Mac."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Voice Wake इस Mac के माइक्रोफ़ोन से सक्रिय करने वाले वाक्यांशों को लगातार सुनता रहेगा।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"سيستمع التنشيط الصوتي باستمرار إلى عبارات التنشيط عبر ميكروفون جهاز Mac هذا."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"L'attivazione vocale resterà continuamente in ascolto delle frasi di attivazione tramite il microfono di questo Mac."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sesle Uyandırma, bu Mac'in mikrofonu aracılığıyla uyandırma ifadelerini sürekli dinler."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Голосова активація постійно прослуховуватиме фрази активації через мікрофон цього Mac."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Voice Wake akan terus mendengarkan frasa pengaktif melalui mikrofon Mac ini."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wybudzanie głosowe będzie stale nasłuchiwać fraz aktywujących przez mikrofon tego Maca."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การปลุกด้วยเสียงจะฟังวลีปลุกอย่างต่อเนื่องผ่านไมโครโฟนของ Mac เครื่องนี้"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tính năng đánh thức bằng giọng nói sẽ liên tục lắng nghe các cụm từ đánh thức qua micrô của máy Mac này."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Voice Wake luistert continu via de microfoon van deze Mac naar activeringszinnen."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"فعال‌سازی صوتی به‌طور مداوم از طریق میکروفون این Mac به عبارت‌های فعال‌سازی گوش می‌دهد."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Голосовая активация будет непрерывно прослушивать фразы активации через микрофон этого Mac."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Röstaktivering lyssnar kontinuerligt efter aktiveringsfraser via den här Mac-datorns mikrofon."}}}},
